   - The code snippet includes a `mutex_lock(&ue->card->user_ctl_lock);` at the beginning and a corresponding `mutex_unlock(&ue->card->user_ctl_lock);` at the end. This indicates that the function locks a mutex to synchronize access to shared data (`ue->elem_data`).

